# Citation metadata for the Explain physiological simulation engine.
# See https://citation-file-format.github.io/ . Fields marked TODO must be
# completed before the first tagged release / Zenodo archival.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Explain: a whole-body physiological simulation engine"
abstract: >-
  Explain is a framework-agnostic, dependency-free physiological simulation
  engine modelling whole-body neonatal and adult cardiorespiratory physiology
  (heart, circulation, respiration, blood gases, metabolism, and a library of
  calibrated patient scenarios). It runs inside a Web Worker and is driven
  through a small message-based API.
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
